{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sweet Train - A simple and beautiful jigsaw puzzle game with train as the theme. It tells the story of the encounters of five pretty and cute girls on the train, accompanied by relaxing music. After completing the level, you can enjoy the girls' photos in the gallery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- The game has three levels of difficulty: 2x2, 2x4, 4x4 puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Press &quot;F&quot; to turn on black and white when doing puzzle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Players can complete the puzzle by pressing the 'Blank' key during the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Players can quickly view girl pictures by pressing the AD key, left and right keys or the left and right keys of the mouse in the gallery</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">* Puzzle image size is 800x960 px</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">* Gallery image size is 1088x960 px</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3598210?t=1742365327","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3598210?t=1742365327","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598210/1fe79c343dbe807f3f9594d219efbd43c71ab6db/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742365327","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598210/1fe79c343dbe807f3f9594d219efbd43c71ab6db/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742365327","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"- Nudity or pornographic content\r\n- Sexual assault/non-consensual sex\r\n- Alcohol abuse\r\n- Contains female masturbation content\r\n- Clear depiction of male/female reproductive organs\r\n- Not suitable for viewing at work\r\n- Not suitable for all ages\r\n- All characters in the game are over 18 years old"},"detailed_description":